---@field registrable boolean Indicates programmatic registration eligibility according to a real-time registry check.
---@field pricing? cloudflare.registrar.CheckResponseDomainsItemPricing|distilled.Null Provides annual pricing information for a given domain. The API returns all per-year prices as strings to preserve decimal precision.
